---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---
<Layout title="Terms and Conditions — Nexus Wave Technologies">
  <section class="hero legal-hero"><div class="container post-hero">
    <p class="eyebrow">Legal</p>
    <h1>Terms and Conditions</h1>
    <p class="lead">These Terms explain how you may use the Nexus Wave Technologies website, product information, tools and related services.</p>
  </div></section>

  <section class="section"><div class="container legal-shell"><nav class="legal-nav" aria-label="Legal pages"><a href="/legal/privacy">Privacy</a><a href="/legal/terms" aria-current="page">Terms</a><a href="/legal/refund">Refunds</a><a href="/legal/disclaimer">Disclaimer</a><a href="/legal/accessibility">Accessibility</a></nav><article class="prose card legal-document">
    <h2>1. Agreement</h2><p>By using this website or a service that references these Terms, you agree to use it lawfully, responsibly and in accordance with the policies shown at the time of use or purchase.</p>
<h2>2. Services</h2><p>Nexus Wave Technologies provides product information, websites, utilities, support entry points, community services and access to products such as Nexus Plus and Geeta Nexus. Specific features can vary by platform, country, device and app version.</p>
<h2>3. Accounts</h2><p>Where an account is required, provide information that you are authorized to provide and keep access credentials secure. You are responsible for activity carried out through your account unless applicable law provides otherwise.</p>
<h2>4. Acceptable use</h2><p>Do not misuse the service, bypass security controls, access accounts or devices without authorization, distribute malware, abuse other users, or use the service for unlawful surveillance or other unlawful activity.</p>
<h2>5. Your content</h2><p>You remain responsible for content you upload, record, create, transfer or process through the services and for having the necessary rights and permissions to use it.</p>
<h2>6. Payments and subscriptions</h2><p>Before a purchase, the applicable checkout or store page should show the product, price, currency and billing terms. Payment and subscription rules may also be governed by the relevant app store or payment provider. Nothing in these Terms removes mandatory consumer rights.</p>
<h2>7. Refunds and cancellations</h2><p>Refunds, cancellations and subscription handling are described in the Refund Policy and any applicable store rules. Where the law gives you a mandatory refund or cancellation right, that right remains unaffected.</p>
<h2>8. AI and automated features</h2><p>AI and automated results can be incomplete or inaccurate. Review important output before relying on it, particularly for legal, medical, financial, safety or other high-stakes decisions.</p>
<h2>9. Third-party services</h2><p>Some features depend on third-party providers such as hosting, authentication, cloud storage, AI, notifications, payments or device services. Their own terms and privacy policies may apply.</p>
<h2>10. Availability and compatibility</h2><p>Features may depend on platform, operating system, hardware, permissions, network access, account configuration and provider availability. We do not promise uninterrupted availability or compatibility with every device.</p>
<h2>11. Accessibility and safety</h2><p>Accessibility, device-control, camera, audio and safety-related features must be used only for their stated purposes and only with the permissions and authorization required by the relevant platform and law.</p>
<h2>12. Account deletion and termination</h2><p>Where an account is provided, supported account controls may allow you to request deletion. We may retain information that we are legally required to keep. Access may be restricted when reasonably necessary for security, abuse prevention, legal compliance or serious misuse.</p>
<h2>13. Contact</h2><p>Email: <a href="mailto:info@nexusweb.co.in">info@nexusweb.co.in</a></p>
<p class="muted">Last updated: October 2, 2026.</p>
  </article></div></section>
<style is:global>
  .legal-hero{padding:72px 0 40px;border-bottom:1px solid var(--color-border);background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--color-surface),var(--color-bg))}
  .legal-hero .lead{max-width:760px}
  .legal-shell{display:grid;grid-template-columns:220px minmax(0,1fr);gap:32px;align-items:start}
  .legal-nav{position:sticky;top:96px;display:grid;gap:6px;padding:8px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:16px;background:var(--color-surface)}
  .legal-nav a{padding:10px 12px;border-radius:10px;color:var(--color-text-muted);text-decoration:none;font-size:.92rem;font-weight:650}
  .legal-nav a:hover,.legal-nav a[aria-current=page]{background:var(--color-surface-soft);color:var(--color-text)}
  .legal-document{padding:32px}
  .legal-document h2{margin:34px 0 10px;font-size:1.35rem}
  .legal-document h2:first-child{margin-top:0}
  .legal-document p{margin:0 0 14px;color:var(--color-text-muted);line-height:1.75}
  .legal-meta{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;margin-top:20px}
  .legal-meta span{padding:7px 10px;border:1px solid var(--color-border);border-radius:999px;font-size:.78rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--color-text-muted)}
  @media(max-width:850px){.legal-shell{grid-template-columns:1fr}.legal-nav{position:static;display:flex;overflow:auto}.legal-nav a{flex:0 0 auto}.legal-document{padding:24px}}
</style>
</Layout>